# area 59 (Temple Grounds, 05_temple_federationsite_dark): the commando is woken and the module's
# own states are forced one after the other, so every trigger is evaluated at least once.
@f30 objs commando
@f60 send u065a Activate
@f120 fsm u065a CoverFind
@f160 fsm u065a JumpPointFind
@f200 fsm u065a Ambush
@f240 fsm u065a Dead
@f280 fsm u065a WallDetach
@f320 fsm u065a SetCoverDest
@f360 fsm u065a SetJumpDest
@f400 fsm u065a SetRetreatDest
@f440 fsm u065a BreakCover
@f480 fsm u065a Cover
@f520 fsm u065a ArmShield
@f560 fsm u065a Lurk
@f600 fsm u065a WarpOut
@f640 fsm u065a PostWarpOut
@f680 objs commando
